  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase private investments in the agricultural and food sectors (production, aggregation, processing, and distribution) and in associated services industries (e.g., logistics, inputs, testing services) through the development of risk reduction mechanisms, the adaptation of investment financial products, and improvement in the effectiveness of investment support measures</narrative>
